{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56137","headline":"三涂五苦颂八首 八 · 杜光庭","name":"三涂五苦颂八首 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大贤乐经戒，受之爲身宝。\n就学早苦晚，治身恨不早。\n比当被幽赜，倏忽年已老。\n执卷吟尔极，将更死通恼。\n吾故及弱龄，弃世以学道。\n（同前卷五十。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56137.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56137","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}